# Conformance probe pack for spec 0.94: a key of a block that is not written. Public.
format     conformance-held-block
version    0.94.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
layout     sequential
bit_order  msb
kind    k
when    8  7
presence p 2
if p.1 !p.2
  field  probe.x  8  uint
end
if p.2
  field  probe.y  8  uint
end
default probe.y  9
